{"id":"659453","name":"凉拌茄子","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/659453/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"5个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子洗净备用。","img":"images/659453/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"划开几条备用(不要切断)。","img":"images/659453/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放锅里蒸熟。","img":"images/659453/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"凉凉备用。","img":"images/659453/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小葱切成葱花放在茄子上。","img":"images/659453/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大蒜加成末放在茄子上。","img":"images/659453/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入辣椒酱一勺。","img":"images/659453/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鹌鹑蛋备用切开。","img":"images/659453/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"摆在大碗旁边。","img":"images/659453/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"吃的时候拌匀即可。","img":"images/659453/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/659453/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}